{"text": "Tu savais que sur Vénus, il pleut de l'acide, mais que pas une goutte ne touche le sol ? Vénus est enveloppée d'épais nuages d'acide sulfurique, très corrosif, de ces nuages tombent des gouttes d'acide, une vraie pluie acide, mais plus bas, il fait si chaud, plus de quatre cents degrés, que les gouttes s'évaporent en route, du coup, il pleut tout le temps sur Vénus, mais son sol reste parfaitement sec. Abonne-toi pour d'autres histoires sur l'univers, et envoie la vidéo à quelqu'un que ça va faire rêver.", "voice": {"id": "TojRWZatQyy9dujEdiQ1", "model": "eleven_multilingual_v2", "tempo": 1.1, "api_speed": 1.1}, "starts": [0.0, 0.104, 0.163, 0.221, 0.255, 0.372, 0.418, 0.464, 0.488, 0.511, 0.546, 0.569, 0.604, 0.65, 0.697, 0.743, 0.848, 0.882, 0.94, 0.975, 1.057, 1.126, 1.231, 1.37, 1.486, 1.625, 1.73, 1.776, 1.846, 1.892, 1.95, 1.985, 2.009, 2.032, 2.055, 2.09, 2.125, 2.171, 2.194, 2.241, 2.299, 2.403, 2.566, 2.624, 2.728, 2.763, 3.019, 3.077, 3.123, 3.146, 3.17, 3.204, 3.228, 3.262, 3.309, 3.367, 3.413, 3.495, 3.541, 3.622, 3.657, 3.704, 3.727, 3.773, 3.831, 3.889, 3.936, 3.971, 3.994, 4.017, 4.052, 4.087, 4.145, 4.191, 4.238, 4.284, 4.331, 4.389, 4.423, 4.447, 4.47, 4.505, 4.563, 4.621, 4.679, 4.841, 4.899, 5.016, 5.062, 5.41, 5.468, 5.573, 5.631, 5.712, 5.735, 5.793, 5.817, 5.84, 5.875, 5.933, 5.956, 6.002, 6.049, 6.084, 6.107, 6.177, 6.2, 6.246, 6.304, 6.351, 6.374, 6.397, 6.444, 6.502, 6.56, 6.618, 6.641, 6.664, 6.699, 6.757, 6.861, 6.943, 7.001, 7.024, 7.047, 7.07, 7.094, 7.14, 7.198, 7.303, 7.442, 7.477, 7.5, 7.535, 7.581, 7.663, 7.721, 7.825, 7.93, 7.999, 8.104, 8.162, 8.185, 8.255, 8.301, 8.487, 8.557, 8.615, 8.661, 8.696, 8.731, 8.777, 8.858, 8.893, 8.94, 8.998, 9.102, 9.218, 9.323, 9.509, 9.694, 9.741, 9.799, 9.845, 9.903, 9.95, 9.973, 10.031, 10.089, 10.17, 10.252, 10.31, 10.344, 10.368, 10.391, 10.437, 10.542, 10.565, 10.6, 10.623, 10.646, 10.67, 10.693, 10.728, 10.786, 10.809, 10.855, 10.913, 10.971, 11.006, 11.041, 11.064, 11.088, 11.111, 1